.Dd $Mdocdate: October 21 2026 $
.Dt DBUPDATE 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dbupdate
.Nd updates system databases
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl fn
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility updates various system databases which are changed by
entities on the internet, validated through our source processes,
but unsuitable for distribution via the
.Xr syspatch 8 ,
.Xr fw_update 8 ,
or
.Xr sysmerge 8
mechanisms.
.Pp
This is a different distribution and polling mechanism which is
kept simple as possible so that it can be run regularily as root
in 
.Xr cron 8 .
.Pp
The two databases currently updated are
.Pa /etc/ssl/cert.pem
and
.Pa /usr/share/zoneinfo .
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl f
.Nm
normally only updates new files.
This option forces download and installation.
.It Fl n
Dry run (prints out what it would have done).
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /var/run/dbupdate
A cache of hashes and signs to optimize download.
.El
.Sh AUTHORS
.An -nosplit
The
.Nm
program was designed by
.An Theo de Raadt .
